OL,3,GNEWSADriverless shuttle bus trial on
OL,4,AMargate road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driverless shuttle bus trial has
OL,7,Ftaken place on the streets of Kent.
OL,9,FThe eight-seater Ohmio Lift electric
OL,10,Fvehicle offered passengers free
OL,11,Fjourneys between Margate railway
OL,12,Fstation and the Turner Contemporary on
OL,13,FFriday as part of the Self Driving
OL,14,FIndustry Awards which were held at the
OL,15,Fvenue.
OL,17,FEast Thanet MP Polly Billington was one
OL,18,Fof the first to use the trial service
OL,19,Fand is backing calls for it to become
OL,20,Fpermanent during the tourist season.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
