OL,3,GNEWSADriverless shuttle bus trial on
OL,4,AMargate road
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People who would otherwise find that
OL,7,Fwalk too far are able to enjoy one of
OL,8,Four greatest attractions," she said.
OL,9,F"Having driverless vehicles means that
OL,10,Fwe are designing in accessibility right
OL,11,Ffrom the start."
